   "why": "The lower bound 43 comes from Exoo's 1989 construction of a 42‑vertex two‑colored K₄₂ with no monochromatic K₅, verified by the journal’s official record. The upper bound 46 is proved by Angeltveit and McKay’s 2024 arXiv preprint using linear programming and extensive computer case checking.",
